Clearlooks XFWM4 Theme
----------------------
Based on Clearlooks Metacity from Fedora 14.

Author: Casey Kirsle
Date: Jan  4 2011

http://www.kirsle.net/

Modified: recoloured to match the Clearlooks GTK theme (title bar colour and frame colour). The shapes are unchanged from the original.
The shade and stick buttons (normal, toggled, pressed, inactive) were added in the same style.
